  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Or at least that's what's supposed to happen. That's what Bartleby saw and he's watching it happen even now. Say 'hi,' to Bartleby.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_140.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "All neat and tidy. If you don't count the fact your tree friend is dead, or that Darkmoor has rotted for centuries waiting for this moment...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_141.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...Both of which Bartleby knew about. He knew from the moment he made you his Scion, from the second you returned his eye.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_142.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "He guided and nudged and commanded you to this day because he believes, deeply, truly, it is the best direction for the Spiral. Well... most of it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_143.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But free will still exists. The rat in the maze, knowing it's being observed, can respond unexpectedly and throw off the whole experiment.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_144.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What if I told you everything I'm doing is to save a world? Our world? Our real world. Earth is suffering, kid, but we can save it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_145.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And so you have a choice. In a few seconds, I'm going to walk through that door. Feel free to pursue, as Bartleby wants.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_146.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Or exit through there. Surprise the Tree. Just leave and take the stand that Earth matters more than manipulation.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_147.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I can set you free. And then all of the power you gained, all the experience wielding it, we can use it to save our world.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_148.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But... the choice is entirely yours.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-SCHOL_149.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-039_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Funny how legend intermingles with history. No, Balaur is not the one who found the Scholomance; he is its founder!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Brain_Jar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Gray_Man_DM-SCHOL_044.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700165,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
